# dg-world s1 — isometric world renderer (tile walk + DrawDungeon order)

Bean: "Isometric world renderer (floor/walls/order)" (parent-managed; this lane
does not create or close beans).

## Files
- internal/render/world.go (new)  — Sink/World/View + DrawWorld/DrawFloor/
  DrawTileContent/DrawOOB/DrawDungeon, WorldToScreen, WalkOffset, dirt fallback
- internal/render/world_test.go (new) — order trace, golden index hashes, y-sort,
  zero-alloc

