- direction.hpp:12-22    Direction ordinal order; :46-50 Opposite

Deviation recorded: DrawDungeon here takes the sink + tile instead of
DrawCell's asserted in-bounds tile position (the walk filters with InBounds
first, exactly like DrawFloor/DrawTileContent/DrawOOB upstream), so no assert is
ported. No sprite pixel decode beyond cel.go was needed; the pass draws through
the Sink, so the software index rasteriser plugs in without touching this file.

